"""Part 9b-iv-b mutations: the paged text box's layout (game/paged_text_box.cpp, LayoutPages and its
helpers).

Run with the text build: --build build_text.bat --check check_text.py (TEXT_TEST; the "paged:"
checks in textbox_test.inc). The deletions are named by the line they delete. The first run caught
97 of 111; after new cases (the measures' rounding at .3, a line's room of exactly 0, the line
before a page's first) 104.

Equivalent (left alive, by design):
  P 320 cmp / num       a byte decoded as itself (1 byte) read again as itself (ASCII).
  P 397 cmp / num       a page index of -1 is never asked for (m_pages[-1] would be read first).
  P 401 / 410 del       the styles are loaded by the time there are lines (SelectStyle loads them).
  P 432 cmp             one word's gap is 0 either way (JustifyPageGap).
"""
